{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"AVO-cultuur 2009, vervolgmodule 3: Receptieve Cultuurparticipatie"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:59748"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau - SCP"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek - CBS"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"SCP  Databeheerder"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Het Aanvullend Voorzieningengebruik Onderzoek is een 4-jaarlijks onderzoek met als doel een goed beeld te krijgen van het gebruik van sociale en culturele voorzieningen door de bevolking van Nederland. Het laatste AVO hoofdonderzoek heeft plaatsgevonden in 2007 en vormt het uitgangspunt voor het vervolgonderzoek AVO-cultuur in 2009. Het onderzoek is uitgevoerd door het CBS op verzoek van en in samenwerking met het Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau (SCP).<\/p><p>Het AVO-cultuur 2009 bestaat uit drie modules: 1. ICT-gebruik voor cultuur, 2. Kunstbeoefening en 3. Receptieve cultuurparticipatie. De data voor module 3 zijn verzameld in de<br>maanden mei en juni 2009.<\/p><p>Deze dataset bevat de data van vervolgmodule 3. Receptieve Cultuurparticipatie, met respondenten van AVO 2007.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Cultuurparticipatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Voorzieningen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vrije tijd"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ontspanning"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ICT"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kunstbeoefening"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amateurkunst"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"AVO2009"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Cultuur"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-11-06"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-11-06"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"c